    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Classify";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Classifies personal identification documents as prohibited for identity verification purposes.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The Act classifies the following documents as prohibited for identity verification: (f) a voice print; (g) a credit or debit card, its number, or data stored or encrypted on it; (h) a financial account number, user name or password; (i) a digital signature; (j) a series of numbers or letters (or both) intended for use as a means of personal identification; (k) an ABN.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The listed documents are prohibited for identity verification purposes.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::dl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
