    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(judge or magistrate is required or authorised by law to admit a person accused of an offence to bail)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The temporal overlap between the judge's or magistrate's actions and their oppressive behavior must be greater than 0.";
