    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Recurring nature of judge's or magistrate's oppressive behavior";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(judge or magistrate is required or authorised by law to admit a person accused of an offence to bail)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The judge's or magistrate's oppressive behavior must be recurring if it requires excessive and unreasonable bail.";
