<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-46-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits aiding a prisoner to escape.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and  (d) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and  (d) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention.";
