    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of rescuing a prisoner from criminal detention.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person rescues the prisoner from that detention by force; and  (c) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person rescues the prisoner from that detention by force; and  (c) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention.";
